          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "### Setup and next steps\n1. In **Defender for Cloud > Environment settings**, select the source subscription and open **Continuous export > Log Analytics workspace**. Export **Regulatory compliance** with both **Streaming updates** and **Snapshots** to the same workspace. [Continuous export setup and permissions](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/defender-for-cloud/continuous-export).\n2. Verify workspace read access, table availability, data retention and expected ingestion/retention costs. Configuration alone does not establish data delivery.\n3. Use **Open Compliance Over Time** below to open Microsoft's published template, then choose the workspace in that workbook. Alternatively, open the built-in workbook from the [Defender for Cloud workbooks gallery](https://portal.azure.com/#view/Microsoft_Azure_Security/SecurityMenuBlade/~/28) (commercial Azure), or follow the [Microsoft workbook guidance](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/defender-for-cloud/custom-dashboards-azure-workbooks#compliance-over-time-workbook). In other clouds, open **Defender for Cloud > Workbooks** in that cloud's portal.\n\nThis view does not change settings, assign policies, create workspaces, or enable billable services."
            },
            "name": "ReadinessNextSteps"
          },
